__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 lbA-DQN">External/GB</p><span class="tooltip__TooltipFocusArea-sc-a85671a6-0 dnzpuK InfoIconWithTooltip-tooltip"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6 InfoIconWithTooltip-icon" aria-hidden="true" color="var(--color-neutral-icon)"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="M2.5 10a7.5 7.5 0 1 0 15 0 7.5 7.5 0 0 0-15 0M10 13.333v.009"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="M10 10.833a1.667 1.667 0 1 0-.314-3.3 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.936.551"></path></svg></span></span></th><td data-plan-id="FREE"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dLgZJq"><b>$0.20</b></div></td><td data-plan-id="STARTER"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dLgZJq"><b>$0.20</b></div></td><td data-plan-id="SCALE"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dLgZJq"><b>$0.19</b></div></td><td data-plan-id="BUSINESS"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dLgZJq"><b>$0.18</b></div></td><td data-plan-id="ENTERPRISE"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dLgZJq">Custom</div></td></tr><tr><th><span class="InfoIconWithTooltip__StyledContainerWithInfoIcon-sc-ba83084e-0 gjaOJd"><p class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 lbA-DQN">Internal/GB</p><span class="tooltip__TooltipFocusArea-sc-a85671a6-0 dnzpuK InfoIconWithTooltip-tooltip"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6 InfoIconWithTooltip-icon" aria-hidden="true" color="var(--color-neutral-icon)"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="M2.5 10a7.5 7.5 0 1 0 15 0 7.5 7.5 0 0 0-15 0M10 13.333v.009"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="M10 10.833a1.667 1.667 0 1 0-.314-3.3 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.936.551"></path></svg></span></span></th><td data-plan-id="FREE"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dLgZJq"><b>$0.05</b></div></td><td data-plan-id="STARTER"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dLgZJq"><b>$0.05</b></div></td><td data-plan-id="SCALE"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dLgZJq"><b>$0.045</b></div></td><td data-plan-id="BUSINESS"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dLgZJq"><b>$0.04</b></div></td><td data-plan-id="ENTERPRISE"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dLgZJq">Custom</div></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section class="ApifyForSection__SectionWrapper-sc-e92c7ffb-2 jdczYj"><div class="ApifyForSection__SpacedWrapper-sc-e92c7ffb-1 eLUscS"><h2 class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 kNJTNj">Apify for</h2></div><div class="ApifyForSection__ApifyForContent-sc-e92c7ffb-0 iXxMtc"><div class="ContentWithIcon__ContentWithIconWrapper-sc-f02bc820-0 bMNRDr Wrapper-override"><a rel="" target="_self" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 etESDF link__StyledAsLink-sc-c6c1be68-0 cvOcBA ContentWithIcon__GridItem-sc-f02bc820-1 izzUCr" href="/resources/startups"><div class="IconWrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="none"><path fill="#555D76" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.25 4A.75.75 0 0 1 3 3.25h3A6.75 6.75 0 0 1 12.75 10a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0A5.25 5.25 0 0 0 6 4.75H3.75V6A5.25 5.25 0 0 0 9 11.25h3a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5H9A6.75 6.75 0 0 1 2.25 6z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path><path fill="#555D76" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M18 8.75A5.25 5.25 0 0 0 12.75 14a.8.8 0 0 1-.043.25H15A5.25 5.25 0 0 0 20.25 9v-.25zm-6.559 5.75A.75.75 0 0 0 12 15.75h3A6.75 6.75 0 0 0 21.75 9V8a.75.75 0 0 0-.75-.75h-3A6.75 6.75 0 0 0 11.25 14c0 .192.072.367.191.5" clip-rule="evenodd"></path><path fill="#555D76" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12 9.25a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v10a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0V10a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><h3 class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 bZgihr text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">Startups</h3><p class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 kEcGBA text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 gIULRu text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dLgZJq">Encouraging startups to grow by making use of online data at scale.</p><span class="Link__StyledActionLink-sc-ca37d6e9-2 dZMtaO ActionLink"><span class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_shared__StyledHeadingShared-sc-3066be55-0 bJufMK">Read more</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6 Link__action-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="M4.167 10h11.667M10.833 15l5-5M10.833 5l5 5"></path></svg></span></a><a rel="" target="_self" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 etESDF link__StyledAsLink-sc-c6c1be68-0 cvOcBA ContentWithIcon__GridItem-sc-f02bc820-1 izzUCr" href="/resources/universities"><div class="IconWrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="none"><path fill="#555D76" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M11.722 4.304a.75.75 0 0 1 .556 0l10 4A.75.75 0 0 1 22.75 9v6a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-4.892l-8.971 3.588a.75.75 0 0 1-.557 0l-10-4a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.392zM19.98 9 12 12.192 4.02 9 12 5.808z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path><path fill="#555D76" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6 9.85a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75V16c0 .368.31.934 1.343 1.45.997.5 2.402.8 3.907.8s2.91-.3 3.907-.8c1.032-.515 1.343-1.082 1.343-1.45v-5.4a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0V16c0 1.224-.954 2.183-2.172 2.792-1.253.627-2.9.958-4.578.958s-3.325-.331-4.578-.958C6.204 18.183 5.25 17.224 5.25 16v-5.4A.75.75 0 0 1 6 9.85" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><h3 class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 bZgihr text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">Universities</h3><p class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 kEcGBA text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 gIULRu text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dLgZJq">We hope to see future generations take advantage of the vast amount of data available online.</p><span class="Link__StyledActionLink-sc-ca37d6e9-2 dZMtaO ActionLink"><span class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_shared__StyledHeadingShared-sc-3066be55-0 bJufMK">Read more</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6 Link__action-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="M4.167 10h11.667M10.833 15l5-5M10.833 5l5 5"></path></svg></span></a><a rel="" target="_self" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 etESDF link__StyledAsLink-sc-c6c1be68-0 cvOcBA ContentWithIcon__GridItem-sc-f02bc820-1 izzUCr" href="/resources/nonprofits"><div class="IconWrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="none"><path fill="#555D76" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.056 11.056a2.75 2.75 0 1 1 3.888 3.888 2.75 2.75 0 0 1-3.889-3.889M12 11.75a1.25 1.25 0 1 0 0 2.5 1.25 1.25 0 0 0 0-2.5M10 18.75A1.25 1.25 0 0 0 8.75 20v1a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-1A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 10 17.25h4A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 16.75 20v1a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-1A1.25 1.25 0 0 0 14 18.75zM15.056 3.055a2.75 2.75 0 1 1 3.889 3.89 2.75 2.75 0 0 1-3.89-3.89M17 3.75a1.25 1.25 0 1 0 0 2.5 1.25 1.25 0 0 0 0-2.5M16.25 10a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h2A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 21.75 12v1a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-1A1.25 1.25 0 0 0 19 10.75h-2a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75M5.055 3.055a2.75 2.75 0 1 1 3.89 3.89 2.75 2.75 0 0 1-3.89-3.89M7 3.75a1.25 1.25 0 1 0 0 2.5 1.25 1.25 0 0 0 0-2.5M5 10.75A1.25 1.25 0 0 0 3.75 12v1a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-1A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 5 9.25h2a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><h3 class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 bZgihr text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">Nonprofits</h3><p class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 kEcGBA text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 gIULRu text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dLgZJq">We believe that online data can help your organization have more impact.</p><span class="Link__StyledActionLink-sc-ca37d6e9-2 dZMtaO ActionLink"><span class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_shared__StyledHeadingShared-sc-3066be55-0 bJufMK">Read more</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6 Link__action-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="M4.167 10h11.667M10.833 15l5-5M10.833 5l5 5"></path></svg></span></a></div></div><div class="ApifyForSection__SpacedWrapper-sc-e92c7ffb-1 eLUscS"></div></section><section class="Section__SectionWrapper-sc-e1b1f799-1 gJcVoG"><div class="Section__SectionInnerWrapper-sc-e1b1f799-0 bDwLPj Section-wrap"><span class="Section-decorator--top"></span><div class="Section-header" data-test="section-header"><h2 class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 fmnkCx Section-heading" id="frequently-asked-questions">Frequently asked questions<a class="Link__StyledNextLink-sc-ca37d6e9-0 gikYAT AnchorCopy__AnchorCopyWrapper-sc-298e6ac2-0 jSTLTI AnchorCopy Heading-anchor-link" aria-label="Copy link to clipboard" href="#frequently-asked-questions"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m7.5 12.5 5-5M9.167 5l.386-.447a4.167 4.167 0 0 1 5.892 5.894l-.445.386M10.833 15l-.33.445a4.223 4.223 0 0 1-5.94 0 4.144 4.144 0 0 1 0-5.893L5 9.167"></path></svg></a></h2><p class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dcWGoU">Got questions? We&#x27;re glad to hear that because we have answers.</p></div><div class="Section-body Section-body--withBorders"><div class="Faqs__StyledFaqs-sc-8596aafa-0 bMHYhW"><script id="json-ld-faqs" type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the prepaid platform usage, and how much do I need?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>The Apify platform has a number of services that are charged based on usages, such as Actors, proxies, data transfer, and storage. See \u003ca href=\"/pricing\">pricing\u003c/a> for the full list of platform services.\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>Each subscription plan comes with a certain amount of prepaid platform usage that is used to pay for services. If your platform usage in a given billing cycle exceeds this prepaid amount, the excess usage will be added to your next invoice, and you&#39;ll get a notification. If you&#39;re on the free plan, your access to Apify&#39;s services will be blocked until the beginning of the next monthly cycle.\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>\u003cstrong>Note that unused usage credits are not rolled over to the next billing cycle, and they expire at the end of the billing cycle.\u003c/strong>\u003c/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I try Apify for free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>Absolutely! We offer a \u003ca href=\"/pricing\">free plan\u003c/a> that lets you use most of the features of the Apify platform, but with certain limits. No credit card is required. The free plan includes Apify Proxy, which is limited to use within the platform and does not extend to external clients.\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>If you&#39;d like a free demo of Apify&#39;s custom solutions, please \u003ca href=\"/contact-sales/demo\">contact us\u003c/a>.\u003c/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which plan should I choose?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>If you&#39;re unsure which plan is right for you, just pick the lowest-priced plan that has all the features you need. If you exceed the prepaid platform usage, you&#39;ll get a notification, and the excess usage will be added to the next invoice (see below for details).\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>You can upgrade to a higher plan at any time in your \u003ca href=\"https://console.apify.com/billing\">Billing\u003c/a> settings, and you&#39;ll only pay for the price difference.\u003c/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the pricing for Actors in Apify Store?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>Every Actor in Apify Store uses one of two pricing models, and each Actor&#39;s page states which one applies to it.\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>\u003cstrong>Pay per event\u003c/strong> - you pay a fixed price for the events the Actor&#39;s developer defines, such as starting the Actor or returning a single result. Most pay-per-event Actors include the Apify platform usage in the event price, but some charge for it separately, so check the pricing section on the Actor&#39;s page.\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>\u003cstrong>Pay per usage\u003c/strong> - the developer charges nothing on top, and you only pay for the platform usage consumed by the Actor&#39;s runs: compute units, data transfer, storage operations, and residential or SERP proxies.\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>Both models draw on the platform usage credits included in your plan, and excess usage is charged to your next invoice. Reading from or writing to a run&#39;s dataset after the run finishes also counts as platform usage.\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>The exact platform usage depends on the specific Actor, the type of job it performs, how often it runs, and for how long. The easiest way to find out the platform usage of an Actor is to perform a test run. You can then review your platform usage in your \u003ca href=\"https://console.apify.com/billing\">Billing\u003c/a> settings and figure out the best subscription plan for your needs.\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>For a full breakdown of both models, see \u003ca href=\"https://docs.apify.com/actors/running/actors-in-store\">Actors in Apify Store\u003c/a>. If you need advice, please \u003ca href=\"/contact-sales\">contact us\u003c/a>.\u003c/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can an AI agent pay for Actor runs without an Apify account?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>Yes. An autonomous agent with a crypto wallet can pay through the agentic payment protocols \u003ca href=\"https://www.x402.org/\">x402\u003c/a> and \u003ca href=\"https://mpp.dev/\">MPP\u003c/a>, with no account and no human sign-up. The agent pays once at \u003ca href=\"https://agi.apify.com/\">agi.apify.com\u003c/a>, receives a temporary Apify API token with a fixed spend cap, and calls the Apify API with it like any other token. Each Actor run is metered against that prepaid balance, and unused balance expires with the token.\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>Agents find the complete, current instructions, including supported chains, terms, and balance checks, at \u003ca href=\"https://agi.apify.com/AGENTS.md\">agi.apify.com/AGENTS.md\u003c/a>.\u003c/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I upgrade, downgrade or cancel my plan?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>You can upgrade, downgrade, or cancel your plan at any time in your \u003ca href=\"https://console.apify.com/billing\">Billing\u003c/a> settings.\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>When you upgrade, your payment will be prorated, so you will only pay for the difference between the old and the new price, taking into account how much of the billing cycle has already passed.\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>When you downgrade, there&#39;s no proration except for the unused platform usage that&#39;s rolled over to the new plan.\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>If you decide to cancel, your subscription will last until the end of the current billing cycle. It won&#39;t be renewed after that. Note that you might still be charged for excess platform usage.\u003c/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What drives the cost of an Actor run?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>Most Actors in Apify Store use pay-per-event pricing. You pay the prices listed on the Actor&#39;s page for events such as returning a result. Pay-per-usage Actors and your own Actors bill platform usage instead, including compute units, storage, proxies, and data transfer. Some pay-per-event Actors charge both. You can check your daily \u003ca href=\"https://console.apify.com/billing\">usage chart\u003c/a> on the Apify platform.\u003c/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens after I run out of prepaid usage?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>If you&#39;re a paying user, you can continue using the platform and will be charged for overage until you reach the usage limit configured in the billing. If you&#39;re on the free plan, you&#39;ll be blocked until the next billing cycle.\u003c/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens to my prepaid usage if I don't use all of it?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>If you don&#39;t consume all your prepaid usage, it disappears at the end of the billing cycle. Go to our \u003ca href=\"/pricing\">pricing\u003c/a> page to learn more about the prepaid usage of all Apify&#39;s subscription plans.\u003c/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why do some of my Actor runs cost more than others?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>On a pay-per-event Actor, a run costs more when it returns more results or triggers more events. When you pay for platform usage, the cost depends on proxies, data transfers, memory, and run duration. It also depends on the number of retries when a request fails.\u003c/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does Apify pay as you go work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>If you&#39;re on one of Apify&#39;s paid plans, you can continue using the platform after reaching the limit by paying the rest as overage. That means you don&#39;t have to change your pricing plan to exceed the usage limit of your current plan.\u003c/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Apify offer any discounts for universities or nonprofit organizations?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>Apify offers discounts on its paid plans to both academic institutions and nonprofit organizations. Students are eligible for 30% off Starter and Scale plans, while nonprofits can get a personalized discount. Learn more at \u003ca href=\"/resources/universities\">Apify for universities\u003c/a> and \u003ca href=\"/resources/nonprofits\">Apify for nonprofits\u003c/a>.\u003c/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do startups get the same pricing as enterprise customers?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>Apify believes in encouraging startups to grow by using online data at scale. So we&#39;re giving a special 30% discount on our Scale plan to startups. Learn more at \u003ca href=\"/resources/startups\">Apify for startups\u003c/a>.\u003c/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"I would like to develop Actors. What should I do?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>\u003ca href=\"https://docs.apify.com/academy\">Apify Academy\u003c/a> is a free course that shows you how to start developing Actors on the Apify platform. You can also find more information in the \u003ca href=\"https://docs.apify.com\">Apify documentation\u003c/a>.\u003c/p>"}}]}</script><div data-test="accordion" class="Accordion__StyledAccordion-sc-2374b547-0 jQrJNK"><button type="button" class="title data-tracking-FAQs-what-is-the-prepaid-platform-usage-and-how-much-do-i-need-pricing" id="what-is-the-prepaid-platform-usage-and-how-much-do-i-need-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="what-is-the-prepaid-platform-usage-and-how-much-do-i-need-answer" data-test="accordion-toggle-button"><div class="title-left"><a class="Link__StyledNextLink-sc-ca37d6e9-0 gikYAT copy-icon" href="#what-is-the-prepaid-platform-usage-and-how-much-do-i-need"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m7.5 12.5 5-5M9.167 5l.386-.447a4.167 4.167 0 0 1 5.892 5.894l-.445.386M10.833 15l-.33.445a4.223 4.223 0 0 1-5.94 0 4.144 4.144 0 0 1 0-5.893L5 9.167"></path></svg></a><h3 id="what-is-the-prepaid-platform-usage-and-how-much-do-i-need" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">What is the prepaid platform usage, and how much do I need?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11 toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-test="accordion-toggle-icon"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m5 7.5 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="AutoHeightTransition__ExpandableContainer-sc-a539847a-0 gGPeke expansion" data-test="accordion-content"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 hBuiuo text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dcWGoU expansion-internal" id="what-is-the-prepaid-platform-usage-and-how-much-do-i-need-answer" aria-labelledby="what-is-the-prepaid-platform-usage-and-how-much-do-i-need-title"><div><p>The Apify platform has a number of services that are charged based on usages, such as Actors, proxies, data transfer, and storage. See <a href="/pricing">pricing</a> for the full list of platform services.</p>
<p>Each subscription plan comes with a certain amount of prepaid platform usage that is used to pay for services. If your platform usage in a given billing cycle exceeds this prepaid amount, the excess usage will be added to your next invoice, and you&#39;ll get a notification. If you&#39;re on the free plan, your access to Apify&#39;s services will be blocked until the beginning of the next monthly cycle.</p>
<p><strong>Note that unused usage credits are not rolled over to the next billing cycle, and they expire at the end of the billing cycle.</strong></p>
</div></div></div></div><div data-test="accordion" class="Accordion__StyledAccordion-sc-2374b547-0 jQrJNK"><button type="button" class="title data-tracking-FAQs-can-i-try-apify-for-free-pricing" id="can-i-try-apify-for-free-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="can-i-try-apify-for-free-answer" data-test="accordion-toggle-button"><div class="title-left"><a class="Link__StyledNextLink-sc-ca37d6e9-0 gikYAT copy-icon" href="#can-i-try-apify-for-free"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m7.5 12.5 5-5M9.167 5l.386-.447a4.167 4.167 0 0 1 5.892 5.894l-.445.386M10.833 15l-.33.445a4.223 4.223 0 0 1-5.94 0 4.144 4.144 0 0 1 0-5.893L5 9.167"></path></svg></a><h3 id="can-i-try-apify-for-free" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">Can I try Apify for free?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11 toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-test="accordion-toggle-icon"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m5 7.5 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="AutoHeightTransition__ExpandableContainer-sc-a539847a-0 gGPeke expansion" data-test="accordion-content"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 hBuiuo text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dcWGoU expansion-internal" id="can-i-try-apify-for-free-answer" aria-labelledby="can-i-try-apify-for-free-title"><div><p>Absolutely! We offer a <a href="/pricing">free plan</a> that lets you use most of the features of the Apify platform, but with certain limits. No credit card is required. The free plan includes Apify Proxy, which is limited to use within the platform and does not extend to external clients.</p>
<p>If you&#39;d like a free demo of Apify&#39;s custom solutions, please <a href="/contact-sales/demo">contact us</a>.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div data-test="accordion" class="Accordion__StyledAccordion-sc-2374b547-0 jQrJNK"><button type="button" class="title data-tracking-FAQs-which-plan-should-i-choose-pricing" id="which-plan-should-i-choose-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="which-plan-should-i-choose-answer" data-test="accordion-toggle-button"><div class="title-left"><a class="Link__StyledNextLink-sc-ca37d6e9-0 gikYAT copy-icon" href="#which-plan-should-i-choose"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m7.5 12.5 5-5M9.167 5l.386-.447a4.167 4.167 0 0 1 5.892 5.894l-.445.386M10.833 15l-.33.445a4.223 4.223 0 0 1-5.94 0 4.144 4.144 0 0 1 0-5.893L5 9.167"></path></svg></a><h3 id="which-plan-should-i-choose" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">Which plan should I choose?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11 toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-test="accordion-toggle-icon"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m5 7.5 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="AutoHeightTransition__ExpandableContainer-sc-a539847a-0 gGPeke expansion" data-test="accordion-content"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 hBuiuo text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dcWGoU expansion-internal" id="which-plan-should-i-choose-answer" aria-labelledby="which-plan-should-i-choose-title"><div><p>If you&#39;re unsure which plan is right for you, just pick the lowest-priced plan that has all the features you need. If you exceed the prepaid platform usage, you&#39;ll get a notification, and the excess usage will be added to the next invoice (see below for details).</p>
<p>You can upgrade to a higher plan at any time in your <a href="https://console.apify.com/billing">Billing</a> settings, and you&#39;ll only pay for the price difference.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div data-test="accordion" class="Accordion__StyledAccordion-sc-2374b547-0 jQrJNK"><button type="button" class="title data-tracking-FAQs-what-is-the-pricing-for-actors-in-apify-store-pricing" id="what-is-the-pricing-for-actors-in-apify-store-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="what-is-the-pricing-for-actors-in-apify-store-answer" data-test="accordion-toggle-button"><div class="title-left"><a class="Link__StyledNextLink-sc-ca37d6e9-0 gikYAT copy-icon" href="#what-is-the-pricing-for-actors-in-apify-store"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m7.5 12.5 5-5M9.167 5l.386-.447a4.167 4.167 0 0 1 5.892 5.894l-.445.386M10.833 15l-.33.445a4.223 4.223 0 0 1-5.94 0 4.144 4.144 0 0 1 0-5.893L5 9.167"></path></svg></a><h3 id="what-is-the-pricing-for-actors-in-apify-store" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">What is the pricing for Actors in Apify Store?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11 toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-test="accordion-toggle-icon"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m5 7.5 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="AutoHeightTransition__ExpandableContainer-sc-a539847a-0 gGPeke expansion" data-test="accordion-content"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 hBuiuo text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dcWGoU expansion-internal" id="what-is-the-pricing-for-actors-in-apify-store-answer" aria-labelledby="what-is-the-pricing-for-actors-in-apify-store-title"><div><p>Every Actor in Apify Store uses one of two pricing models, and each Actor&#39;s page states which one applies to it.</p>
<p><strong>Pay per event</strong> - you pay a fixed price for the events the Actor&#39;s developer defines, such as starting the Actor or returning a single result. Most pay-per-event Actors include the Apify platform usage in the event price, but some charge for it separately, so check the pricing section on the Actor&#39;s page.</p>
<p><strong>Pay per usage</strong> - the developer charges nothing on top, and you only pay for the platform usage consumed by the Actor&#39;s runs: compute units, data transfer, storage operations, and residential or SERP proxies.</p>
<p>Both models draw on the platform usage credits included in your plan, and excess usage is charged to your next invoice. Reading from or writing to a run&#39;s dataset after the run finishes also counts as platform usage.</p>
<p>The exact platform usage depends on the specific Actor, the type of job it performs, how often it runs, and for how long. The easiest way to find out the platform usage of an Actor is to perform a test run. You can then review your platform usage in your <a href="https://console.apify.com/billing">Billing</a> settings and figure out the best subscription plan for your needs.</p>
<p>For a full breakdown of both models, see <a href="https://docs.apify.com/actors/running/actors-in-store">Actors in Apify Store</a>. If you need advice, please <a href="/contact-sales">contact us</a>.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div data-test="accordion" class="Accordion__StyledAccordion-sc-2374b547-0 jQrJNK"><button type="button" class="title data-tracking-FAQs-can-an-ai-agent-pay-for-actor-runs-without-an-apify-account-pricing" id="can-an-ai-agent-pay-for-actor-runs-without-an-apify-account-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="can-an-ai-agent-pay-for-actor-runs-without-an-apify-account-answer" data-test="accordion-toggle-button"><div class="title-left"><a class="Link__StyledNextLink-sc-ca37d6e9-0 gikYAT copy-icon" href="#can-an-ai-agent-pay-for-actor-runs-without-an-apify-account"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m7.5 12.5 5-5M9.167 5l.386-.447a4.167 4.167 0 0 1 5.892 5.894l-.445.386M10.833 15l-.33.445a4.223 4.223 0 0 1-5.94 0 4.144 4.144 0 0 1 0-5.893L5 9.167"></path></svg></a><h3 id="can-an-ai-agent-pay-for-actor-runs-without-an-apify-account" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">Can an AI agent pay for Actor runs without an Apify account?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11 toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-test="accordion-toggle-icon"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m5 7.5 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="AutoHeightTransition__ExpandableContainer-sc-a539847a-0 gGPeke expansion" data-test="accordion-content"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 hBuiuo text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dcWGoU expansion-internal" id="can-an-ai-agent-pay-for-actor-runs-without-an-apify-account-answer" aria-labelledby="can-an-ai-agent-pay-for-actor-runs-without-an-apify-account-title"><div><p>Yes. An autonomous agent with a crypto wallet can pay through the agentic payment protocols <a href="https://www.x402.org/">x402</a> and <a href="https://mpp.dev/">MPP</a>, with no account and no human sign-up. The agent pays once at <a href="https://agi.apify.com/">agi.apify.com</a>, receives a temporary Apify API token with a fixed spend cap, and calls the Apify API with it like any other token. Each Actor run is metered against that prepaid balance, and unused balance expires with the token.</p>
<p>Agents find the complete, current instructions, including supported chains, terms, and balance checks, at <a href="https://agi.apify.com/AGENTS.md">agi.apify.com/AGENTS.md</a>.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div data-test="accordion" class="Accordion__StyledAccordion-sc-2374b547-0 jQrJNK"><button type="button" class="title data-tracking-FAQs-can-i-upgrade-downgrade-or-cancel-my-plan-pricing" id="can-i-upgrade-downgrade-or-cancel-my-plan-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="can-i-upgrade-downgrade-or-cancel-my-plan-answer" data-test="accordion-toggle-button"><div class="title-left"><a class="Link__StyledNextLink-sc-ca37d6e9-0 gikYAT copy-icon" href="#can-i-upgrade-downgrade-or-cancel-my-plan"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m7.5 12.5 5-5M9.167 5l.386-.447a4.167 4.167 0 0 1 5.892 5.894l-.445.386M10.833 15l-.33.445a4.223 4.223 0 0 1-5.94 0 4.144 4.144 0 0 1 0-5.893L5 9.167"></path></svg></a><h3 id="can-i-upgrade-downgrade-or-cancel-my-plan" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">Can I upgrade, downgrade or cancel my plan?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11 toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-test="accordion-toggle-icon"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m5 7.5 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="AutoHeightTransition__ExpandableContainer-sc-a539847a-0 gGPeke expansion" data-test="accordion-content"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 hBuiuo text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dcWGoU expansion-internal" id="can-i-upgrade-downgrade-or-cancel-my-plan-answer" aria-labelledby="can-i-upgrade-downgrade-or-cancel-my-plan-title"><div><p>You can upgrade, downgrade, or cancel your plan at any time in your <a href="https://console.apify.com/billing">Billing</a> settings.</p>
<p>When you upgrade, your payment will be prorated, so you will only pay for the difference between the old and the new price, taking into account how much of the billing cycle has already passed.</p>
<p>When you downgrade, there&#39;s no proration except for the unused platform usage that&#39;s rolled over to the new plan.</p>
<p>If you decide to cancel, your subscription will last until the end of the current billing cycle. It won&#39;t be renewed after that. Note that you might still be charged for excess platform usage.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div data-test="accordion" class="Accordion__StyledAccordion-sc-2374b547-0 jQrJNK"><button type="button" class="title data-tracking-FAQs-what-drives-the-cost-of-an-actor-run-pricing" id="what-drives-the-cost-of-an-actor-run-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="what-drives-the-cost-of-an-actor-run-answer" data-test="accordion-toggle-button"><div class="title-left"><a class="Link__StyledNextLink-sc-ca37d6e9-0 gikYAT copy-icon" href="#what-drives-the-cost-of-an-actor-run"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m7.5 12.5 5-5M9.167 5l.386-.447a4.167 4.167 0 0 1 5.892 5.894l-.445.386M10.833 15l-.33.445a4.223 4.223 0 0 1-5.94 0 4.144 4.144 0 0 1 0-5.893L5 9.167"></path></svg></a><h3 id="what-drives-the-cost-of-an-actor-run" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">What drives the cost of an Actor run?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11 toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-test="accordion-toggle-icon"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m5 7.5 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="AutoHeightTransition__ExpandableContainer-sc-a539847a-0 gGPeke expansion" data-test="accordion-content"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 hBuiuo text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dcWGoU expansion-internal" id="what-drives-the-cost-of-an-actor-run-answer" aria-labelledby="what-drives-the-cost-of-an-actor-run-title"><div><p>Most Actors in Apify Store use pay-per-event pricing. You pay the prices listed on the Actor&#39;s page for events such as returning a result. Pay-per-usage Actors and your own Actors bill platform usage instead, including compute units, storage, proxies, and data transfer. Some pay-per-event Actors charge both. You can check your daily <a href="https://console.apify.com/billing">usage chart</a> on the Apify platform.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div data-test="accordion" class="Accordion__StyledAccordion-sc-2374b547-0 jQrJNK"><button type="button" class="title data-tracking-FAQs-what-happens-after-i-run-out-of-prepaid-usage-pricing" id="what-happens-after-i-run-out-of-prepaid-usage-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="what-happens-after-i-run-out-of-prepaid-usage-answer" data-test="accordion-toggle-button"><div class="title-left"><a class="Link__StyledNextLink-sc-ca37d6e9-0 gikYAT copy-icon" href="#what-happens-after-i-run-out-of-prepaid-usage"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m7.5 12.5 5-5M9.167 5l.386-.447a4.167 4.167 0 0 1 5.892 5.894l-.445.386M10.833 15l-.33.445a4.223 4.223 0 0 1-5.94 0 4.144 4.144 0 0 1 0-5.893L5 9.167"></path></svg></a><h3 id="what-happens-after-i-run-out-of-prepaid-usage" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">What happens after I run out of prepaid usage?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11 toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-test="accordion-toggle-icon"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m5 7.5 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="AutoHeightTransition__ExpandableContainer-sc-a539847a-0 gGPeke expansion" data-test="accordion-content"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 hBuiuo text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dcWGoU expansion-internal" id="what-happens-after-i-run-out-of-prepaid-usage-answer" aria-labelledby="what-happens-after-i-run-out-of-prepaid-usage-title"><div><p>If you&#39;re a paying user, you can continue using the platform and will be charged for overage until you reach the usage limit configured in the billing. If you&#39;re on the free plan, you&#39;ll be blocked until the next billing cycle.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div data-test="accordion" class="Accordion__StyledAccordion-sc-2374b547-0 jQrJNK"><button type="button" class="title data-tracking-FAQs-what-happens-to-my-prepaid-usage-if-i-dont-use-all-of-it-pricing" id="what-happens-to-my-prepaid-usage-if-i-dont-use-all-of-it-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="what-happens-to-my-prepaid-usage-if-i-dont-use-all-of-it-answer" data-test="accordion-toggle-button"><div class="title-left"><a class="Link__StyledNextLink-sc-ca37d6e9-0 gikYAT copy-icon" href="#what-happens-to-my-prepaid-usage-if-i-dont-use-all-of-it"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m7.5 12.5 5-5M9.167 5l.386-.447a4.167 4.167 0 0 1 5.892 5.894l-.445.386M10.833 15l-.33.445a4.223 4.223 0 0 1-5.94 0 4.144 4.144 0 0 1 0-5.893L5 9.167"></path></svg></a><h3 id="what-happens-to-my-prepaid-usage-if-i-dont-use-all-of-it" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">What happens to my prepaid usage if I don&#x27;t use all of it?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11 toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-test="accordion-toggle-icon"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m5 7.5 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="AutoHeightTransition__ExpandableContainer-sc-a539847a-0 gGPeke expansion" data-test="accordion-content"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 hBuiuo text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dcWGoU expansion-internal" id="what-happens-to-my-prepaid-usage-if-i-dont-use-all-of-it-answer" aria-labelledby="what-happens-to-my-prepaid-usage-if-i-dont-use-all-of-it-title"><div><p>If you don&#39;t consume all your prepaid usage, it disappears at the end of the billing cycle. Go to our <a href="/pricing">pricing</a> page to learn more about the prepaid usage of all Apify&#39;s subscription plans.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div data-test="accordion" class="Accordion__StyledAccordion-sc-2374b547-0 jQrJNK"><button type="button" class="title data-tracking-FAQs-why-do-some-of-my-actor-runs-cost-more-than-others-pricing" id="why-do-some-of-my-actor-runs-cost-more-than-others-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="why-do-some-of-my-actor-runs-cost-more-than-others-answer" data-test="accordion-toggle-button"><div class="title-left"><a class="Link__StyledNextLink-sc-ca37d6e9-0 gikYAT copy-icon" href="#why-do-some-of-my-actor-runs-cost-more-than-others"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m7.5 12.5 5-5M9.167 5l.386-.447a4.167 4.167 0 0 1 5.892 5.894l-.445.386M10.833 15l-.33.445a4.223 4.223 0 0 1-5.94 0 4.144 4.144 0 0 1 0-5.893L5 9.167"></path></svg></a><h3 id="why-do-some-of-my-actor-runs-cost-more-than-others" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">Why do some of my Actor runs cost more than others?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11 toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-test="accordion-toggle-icon"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m5 7.5 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="AutoHeightTransition__ExpandableContainer-sc-a539847a-0 gGPeke expansion" data-test="accordion-content"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 hBuiuo text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dcWGoU expansion-internal" id="why-do-some-of-my-actor-runs-cost-more-than-others-answer" aria-labelledby="why-do-some-of-my-actor-runs-cost-more-than-others-title"><div><p>On a pay-per-event Actor, a run costs more when it returns more results or triggers more events. When you pay for platform usage, the cost depends on proxies, data transfers, memory, and run duration. It also depends on the number of retries when a request fails.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div data-test="accordion" class="Accordion__StyledAccordion-sc-2374b547-0 jQrJNK"><button type="button" class="title data-tracking-FAQs-how-does-apify-pay-as-you-go-work-pricing" id="how-does-apify-pay-as-you-go-work-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="how-does-apify-pay-as-you-go-work-answer" data-test="accordion-toggle-button"><div class="title-left"><a class="Link__StyledNextLink-sc-ca37d6e9-0 gikYAT copy-icon" href="#how-does-apify-pay-as-you-go-work"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m7.5 12.5 5-5M9.167 5l.386-.447a4.167 4.167 0 0 1 5.892 5.894l-.445.386M10.833 15l-.33.445a4.223 4.223 0 0 1-5.94 0 4.144 4.144 0 0 1 0-5.893L5 9.167"></path></svg></a><h3 id="how-does-apify-pay-as-you-go-work" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">How does Apify pay as you go work?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11 toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-test="accordion-toggle-icon"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m5 7.5 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="AutoHeightTransition__ExpandableContainer-sc-a539847a-0 gGPeke expansion" data-test="accordion-content"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 hBuiuo text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dcWGoU expansion-internal" id="how-does-apify-pay-as-you-go-work-answer" aria-labelledby="how-does-apify-pay-as-you-go-work-title"><div><p>If you&#39;re on one of Apify&#39;s paid plans, you can continue using the platform after reaching the limit by paying the rest as overage. That means you don&#39;t have to change your pricing plan to exceed the usage limit of your current plan.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div data-test="accordion" class="Accordion__StyledAccordion-sc-2374b547-0 jQrJNK"><button type="button" class="title data-tracking-FAQs-does-apify-offer-any-discounts-for-universities-or-nonprofit-organizations-pricing" id="does-apify-offer-any-discounts-for-universities-or-nonprofit-organizations-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="does-apify-offer-any-discounts-for-universities-or-nonprofit-organizations-answer" data-test="accordion-toggle-button"><div class="title-left"><a class="Link__StyledNextLink-sc-ca37d6e9-0 gikYAT copy-icon" href="#does-apify-offer-any-discounts-for-universities-or-nonprofit-organizations"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m7.5 12.5 5-5M9.167 5l.386-.447a4.167 4.167 0 0 1 5.892 5.894l-.445.386M10.833 15l-.33.445a4.223 4.223 0 0 1-5.94 0 4.144 4.144 0 0 1 0-5.893L5 9.167"></path></svg></a><h3 id="does-apify-offer-any-discounts-for-universities-or-nonprofit-organizations" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">Does Apify offer any discounts for universities or nonprofit organizations?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11 toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-test="accordion-toggle-icon"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m5 7.5 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="AutoHeightTransition__ExpandableContainer-sc-a539847a-0 gGPeke expansion" data-test="accordion-content"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 hBuiuo text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dcWGoU expansion-internal" id="does-apify-offer-any-discounts-for-universities-or-nonprofit-organizations-answer" aria-labelledby="does-apify-offer-any-discounts-for-universities-or-nonprofit-organizations-title"><div><p>Apify offers discounts on its paid plans to both academic institutions and nonprofit organizations. Students are eligible for 30% off Starter and Scale plans, while nonprofits can get a personalized discount. Learn more at <a href="/resources/universities">Apify for universities</a> and <a href="/resources/nonprofits">Apify for nonprofits</a>.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div data-test="accordion" class="Accordion__StyledAccordion-sc-2374b547-0 jQrJNK"><button type="button" class="title data-tracking-FAQs-do-startups-get-the-same-pricing-as-enterprise-customers-pricing" id="do-startups-get-the-same-pricing-as-enterprise-customers-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="do-startups-get-the-same-pricing-as-enterprise-customers-answer" data-test="accordion-toggle-button"><div class="title-left"><a class="Link__StyledNextLink-sc-ca37d6e9-0 gikYAT copy-icon" href="#do-startups-get-the-same-pricing-as-enterprise-customers"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m7.5 12.5 5-5M9.167 5l.386-.447a4.167 4.167 0 0 1 5.892 5.894l-.445.386M10.833 15l-.33.445a4.223 4.223 0 0 1-5.94 0 4.144 4.144 0 0 1 0-5.893L5 9.167"></path></svg></a><h3 id="do-startups-get-the-same-pricing-as-enterprise-customers" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">Do startups get the same pricing as enterprise customers?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11 toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-test="accordion-toggle-icon"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m5 7.5 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="AutoHeightTransition__ExpandableContainer-sc-a539847a-0 gGPeke expansion" data-test="accordion-content"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 hBuiuo text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dcWGoU expansion-internal" id="do-startups-get-the-same-pricing-as-enterprise-customers-answer" aria-labelledby="do-startups-get-the-same-pricing-as-enterprise-customers-title"><div><p>Apify believes in encouraging startups to grow by using online data at scale. So we&#39;re giving a special 30% discount on our Scale plan to startups. Learn more at <a href="/resources/startups">Apify for startups</a>.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div data-test="accordion" class="Accordion__StyledAccordion-sc-2374b547-0 jQrJNK"><button type="button" class="title data-tracking-FAQs-i-would-like-to-develop-actors-what-should-i-do-pricing" id="i-would-like-to-develop-actors-what-should-i-do-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="i-would-like-to-develop-actors-what-should-i-do-answer" data-test="accordion-toggle-button"><div class="title-left"><a class="Link__StyledNextLink-sc-ca37d6e9-0 gikYAT copy-icon" href="#i-would-like-to-develop-actors-what-should-i-do"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_16_1678j_6" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m7.5 12.5 5-5M9.167 5l.386-.447a4.167 4.167 0 0 1 5.892 5.894l-.445.386M10.833 15l-.33.445a4.223 4.223 0 0 1-5.94 0 4.144 4.144 0 0 1 0-5.893L5 9.167"></path></svg></a><h3 id="i-would-like-to-develop-actors-what-should-i-do" class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr heading_marketing__StyledHeadingMarketing-sc-24919fb0-0 jmVzNu">I would like to develop Actors. What should I do?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11 toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-test="accordion-toggle-icon"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="m5 7.5 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="AutoHeightTransition__ExpandableContainer-sc-a539847a-0 gGPeke expansion" data-test="accordion-content"><div class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 hBuiuo text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 dcWGoU expansion-internal" id="i-would-like-to-develop-actors-what-should-i-do-answer" aria-labelledby="i-would-like-to-develop-actors-what-should-i-do-title"><div><p><a href="https://docs.apify.com/academy">Apify Academy</a> is a free course that shows you how to start developing Actors on the Apify platform. You can also find more information in the <a href="https://docs.apify.com">Apify documentation</a>.</p>
</div></div></div></div><p class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 gIULRu text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 DPzZy Faqs-contactUs">Couldn&#x27;t find something? <a class="Link__StyledLink-sc-ca37d6e9-1 fFjvF Faqs-contactUsLink">Message us</a>.</p></div></div><span class="Section-decorator--bottom Section-decorator--bottom--connector"></span></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="StyledFooter__StyledWebFooter-sc-65062a8a-0 jUgYuZ"><div class="WebFooter-footMenuOuter"><div class="WebFooter-navigation" data-test="web-footer-navigation"><div data-accordion-component="Accordion" class="accordion"><div data-accordion-component="AccordionItem" class="WebFooter-accordionItem"><div data-accordion-component="AccordionItemHeading" role="heading" class="accordion__heading" aria-level="3"><div class="WebFooter-accordionItemButton" id="accordion__heading-_R_5elb_" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion__panel-_R_5elb_" role="button" tabindex="0" data-accordion-component="AccordionItemButton"><p class="box__StyledBox-sc-df7907ba-0 gVScJa text_base__StyledText-sc-4f18f771-0 faRhVr text_marketing__StyledTextMarketing-sc-bc174923-0 brIOtl">Product</p><div class="icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11 plus" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="M10 4.167v11.666M4.167 10h11.666"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="_icon_20_1678j_11 minus" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.667" d="M4.167 10h11.666"></path></svg></div></div></div><div data-accordion-component="AccordionItemPanel" class="WebFooter-accordionItemPanel" id="accordion__panel-_R_5elb_" hidden=""><ul class="WebFooter-footMenu"><li class="data-tracking-p